Error [E0041]: `Mutex` is not a Jet API; use a channel, or `Shared<T>` with `Condition`
  --> tests/ui/mutex_teaching.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     Mutex(42)
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: Tasks pass owned values over channels; when tasks must share memory, `Shared<T>` guards the state under a lock and `Condition` coordinates predicate waits
 Fix: Create `channel<T>()` and send owned values, or write `shared value` and edit it through `guard_edit()` (a guard can `wait` on a `Condition`)
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0041
